Each simulated network is drawn from the model at one of 100 posterior draws
(evenly spaced over the stored draws). MC p-value: 2 min(P(simulated <=
observed), P(simulated >= observed)), at most 1, as in latentnet. Missing
dyads of the observed network count as no tie.

